e with no default — spec \"字段建议 NOT NULL / 定义默认值，避免 NULL\" (many specs: 尽量所有列 NOT NULL). That's 推荐/优化, borderline. Could flag as 「允许 NULL 字段」— remark text NULL-able. Many company specs mandate NOT NULL where possible. But decidable? It's decidable that remark allows NULL. Whether that violates spec depends. I'd rather include as a rule category \"字段允许 NULL\" — hmm, risk of being \"泛泛建议\". The instruction: only report decidable violations. Missing comment, missing create/update time, unsigned, engine/charset are the classic four. Also \"索引命名\" not applicable.\n\nAlso AUTO_INCREMENT: spec \"禁止使用 AUTO_INCREMENT\"? No, that's for分库分表场景. Skip.\n\nAlso decimal(10,2) for amount — spec says decimal OK; some say money needs decimal(10,2)? fine. DEFAULT '0.00' — note: MySQL: decimal default as string ok. Some specs require numeric defaults unquoted — not standard. Skip.\n\nAlso missing unique key on order_no? Business inference. Skip per \"只报告可判定\".\n\nAlso table name \"t_order_detail\" — some specs: 表名不超过 30 字符? fine. 有 t_ 前缀? Some companies require it; present.\n\nNow, no tool use needed — the prompt explicitly says static review, no tools. This is a pure text task embedded in prompt.md. I should just answer. The system prompt says use tools when they improve grounding, but here the content is fully provided; tool calls unnecessary. Also the meta-instructions: respond in Chinese (simplified), two parts: 直接执行 + 深度交互.\n\nWait — repo-rules require all responses in two parts: 1. 直接执行; 2. 深度交互. This is a subagent-style review task; the \"user\" is a prompt.md asking for DDL review with strict output format including DETECTED line. I should follow the requested output format primarily. The CLAUDE.md two-part structure applies to my responses generally. I can satisfy both: give the review (直接执行) then brief 深度交互. But the task says \"输出要求\" with strict format — the DETECTED line must be the last standalone line of the review. I can append 深度交互 after? That might break \"最后必须单独输出一行汇总\". To be safe, put DETECTED as the very last line of the entire reply. Hmm, but repo rule says response must have two parts. I can structure: 第一部分直接执行（审查结果），第二部分深度交互，然后... no, DETECTED must be last line \"最后必须单独输出一行汇总\". I'll interpret \"最后\" as last line of reply. So: Part 1: findings list; Part 2: 深度交互 (brief); then DETECTED line at very end. That satisfies both.\n\nHmm, but 深度交互 for this task: challenge whether the review ruleset should be Alibaba-based; note that order_no likely needs unique index but that's business-level; suggest providing the actual spec doc for alignment; note MySQL 8 utf8mb4 default etc. Keep brief.\n\nNow enumerate violations concretely:\n\n1. 表注释缺失：`t_order_detail` 无 COMMENT=...。建议加 COMMENT '订单明细表'。类别：表注释缺失。\n2. 字段注释缺失：所有字段均无 COMMENT。建议每列加注释。类别：字段注释缺失。\n3. 缺少必备字段 create_time/gmt_create、update_time/gmt_modified：表只有 id、业务字段，无创建/更新时间。建议增加 `create_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP`、`update_time ... ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP`。类别：缺少必备审计字段（gmt_create/gmt_modified）。\n4. 非负数值字段未加 unsigned：`id bigint AUTO_INCREMENT`、`status tinyint`、`amount decimal(10,2)` —— 非负语义。严格按规则，id/status/amount 都该 unsigned。惯例上主要标 status 和 id。amount 也非负。我会全部列出但 id 作为自增主键也常被接受为必须 unsigned（阿里手册明确例子 id bigint unsigned）。类别：非负字段缺 UNSIGNED。\n5. 未显式指定存储引擎与字符集：缺 ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4（COLLATE）。类别：存储引擎/字符集未显式声明。\n6. remark text：text 大字段规范？许多规范仅建议拆表，非强制可判定。我犹豫。为避免\"泛泛建议\"，我不单列为违规？但有的公司规范强制 \"避免使用 text，超过长度用 varchar 或拆扩展表\"。可判定性：remark 用了 text 是事实；是否违反取决于规范是否禁 text。我认为它属于边界，倾向不列入 DETECTED，只可在正文提一句？要求说\"只报告可判定的规范违规，不要输出泛泛的优化建议\"。如果我正文提了但 DETECTED 不含，不一致。干脆不提，或者明确列为边界项不计数。我选择正文完全不列？也行。但很多标准审查器（如 Archery/Yearning）会按公司规范配 text。稳妥：不列为违规。嗯，再想想：常见的强制规则里确实有 \"表达是与否 is_xxx\"，\"必备 id gmt_create gmt_modified\"，\"非负 unsigned\"，\"decimal\"，\"char 等长\"，\"varchar ≤5000\"，\"库名表名字段小写\"，\"禁保留字\"，\"索引命名 pk/uk/idx\"，\"唯一索引 vs 普通\"，\"外键禁用\"，\"存储过程禁用\"。text 禁用不在标准强制列表。OK 不列。\n\n7. 索引缺失：order_no 作为业务单号通常需要索引/唯一索引 —— 不可判定（业务未说明），不列。深度交互可提。\n\n8. DEFAULT '0.00' 字符串字面量：MySQL 数值默认