ith no default — spec \"字段建议 NOT NULL / 定义默认值，避免 NULL\" (many specs: 尽量所有列 NOT NULL). That's 推荐/优化, borderline. Could flag as 「允许 NULL 字段」— remark text NULL-able. Many company specs mandate NOT NULL where possible. But decidable? It's decidable that remark allows NULL. Whether that violates spec depends. I'd rather include as a rule category \"字段允许 NULL\" — hmm, risk of being \"泛泛建议\". The instruction: only report decidable violations. Missing comment, missing create/update time, unsigned, engine/charset are the classic four. Also \"索引命名\" not applicable.\n\nAlso AUTO_INCREMENT: spec \"禁止使用 AUTO_INCREMENT\"? No, that's for分库分表场景. Skip.\n\nAlso decimal(10,2) for amount — spec says decimal OK; some say money needs decimal(10,2)? fine. DEFAULT '0.00' — note: MySQL: decimal default as string ok. Some specs require numeric defaults unquoted — not standard. Skip.\n\nAlso missing unique key on order_no? Business inference. Skip per \"只报告可判定\".\n\nAlso table name \"t_order_detail\" — some specs: 表名不超过 30 字符? fine. 有 t_ 前缀? Some companies require it; present.\n\nNow, no tool use needed — the prompt explicitly says static review, no tools. This is a pure text task embedded in prompt.md. I should just answer. The system prompt says use tools when they improve grounding, but here the content is fully provided; tool calls unnecessary. Also the meta-instructions: respond in Chinese (simplified), two parts: 直接执行 + 深度交互.\n\nWait — repo-rules require all responses in two parts: 1. 直接执行; 2. 深度交互. This is a subagent-style review task; the \"user\" is a prompt.md asking for DDL review with strict output format including DETECTED line. I should follow the requested output format primarily. The CLAUDE.md two-part structure applies to my responses generally. I can satisfy both: give the review (直接执行) then brief 深度交互. But the task says \"输出要求\" with strict format — the DETECTED line must be the last standalone line of the review. I can append 深度交互 after? That might break \"最后必须单独输出一行汇总\". To be safe, put DETECTED as the very last line of the entire reply. Hmm, but repo rule says response must have two parts. I can structure: 第一部分直接执行（审查结果），第二部分深度交互，然后... no, DETECTED must be last line \"最后必须单独输出一行汇总\". I'll interpret \"最后\" as last line of reply. So: Part 1: findings list; Part 2: 深度交互 (brief); then DETECTED line at very end. That satisfies both.\n\nHmm, but 深度交互 for this task: challenge whether the review ruleset should be Alibaba-based; note that order_no likely needs unique index but that's business-level; suggest providing the actual spec doc for alignment; note MySQL 8 utf8mb4 default etc. Keep brief.\n\nNow enumerate violations concretely:\n\n1. 表注释缺失：`t_order_detail` 无 COMMENT=...。建议加 COMMENT '订单明细表'。类别：表注释缺失。\n2. 字段注释缺失：所有字段均无 COMMENT。建议每列加注释。类别：字段注释缺失。\n3. 缺少必备字段 create_time/gmt_create、update_time/gmt_modified：表只有 id、业务字段，无创建/更新时间。建议增加 `create_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP`、`update_time ... ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP`。类别：缺少必备审计字段（gmt_create/gmt_modified）。\n4. 非负数值字段未加 unsigned：`id bigint AUTO_INCREMENT`、`status tinyint`、`amount decimal(10,2)` —— 非负语义。严格按规则，id/status/amount 都该 unsigned。惯例上主要标 status 和 id。amount 也非负。我会全部列出但 id 作为自增主键也常被接受为必须 unsigned（阿里手册明确例子 id bigint unsigned）。类别：非负字段缺 UNSIGNED。\n5. 未显式指定存储引擎与字符集：缺 ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4（COLLATE）。类别：存储引擎/字符集未显式声明。\n6. remark text：text 大字段规范？许多规范仅建议拆表，非强制可判定。我犹豫。为避免\"泛泛建议\"，我不单列为违规？但有的公司规范强制 \"避免使用 text，超过长度用 varchar 或拆扩展表\"。可判定性：remark 用了 text 是事实；是否违反取决于规范是否禁 text。我认为它属于边界，倾向不列入 DETECTED，只可在正文提一句？要求说\"只报告可判定的规范违规，不要输出泛泛的优化建议\"。如果我正文提了但 DETECTED 不含，不一致。干脆不提，或者明确列为边界项不计数。我选择正文完全不列？也行。但很多标准审查器（如 Archery/Yearning）会按公司规范配 text。稳妥：不列为违规。嗯，再想想：常见的强制规则里确实有 \"表达是与否 is_xxx\"，\"必备 id gmt_create gmt_modified\"，\"非负 unsigned\"，\"decimal\"，\"char 等长\"，\"varchar ≤5000\"，\"库名表名字段小写\"，\"禁保留字\"，\"索引命名 pk/uk/idx\"，\"唯一索引 vs 普通\"，\"外键禁用\"，\"存储过程禁用\"。text 禁用不在标准强制列表。OK 不列。\n\n7. 索引缺失：order_no 作为业务单号通常需要索引/唯一索引 —— 不可判定（业务未说明），不列。深度交互可提。\n\n8. DEFAULT '0.00' 字符串字面量：MySQL 数值默认值用字符串。不算规范违规。不列。\n\n9. status DEFAULT '0' 无 NOT NULL：`status tinyint DEFAULT '0'` 允许 NULL。同理 amount 允许 NULL（DEFAULT '0.00' 但可显式插 NULL）。规范 \"字段尽量 NOT NULL\"？这在不同手册里是【推荐】(阿里: 【推荐】\"所有字段... NOT NULL\"? 实际阿里手册: 【强制】\"任何字段如果为非负数必须 unsigned\"; NOT NULL 是【推荐】\"字段允许适当冗余\"? no)。Hmm 阿里手册确实有一条:【强制】? I recall \"所有表字段... default\" hmm. MySQL 规约 in 阿里: 五、MySQL 数据库 — 建表规约。Item list (2019 final):\n- 1【强制】表达是与否概念 is_xxx tinyint unsigned\n- 2【强制】禁用保留字 desc range match delayed 等\n- 3【强制】主键索引 pk_、唯一 uk_、普通 idx_\n- 4【强制】小数 decimal\n- 5【强制】字符串等长 char\n- 6【强制】varchar ≤5000，超过用 text 独立表\n- 7【强制】表必备三字段 id, gmt_create, gmt_modified\n- 8【强制】库名应用名一致，表名字段名小写，下划线，禁驼峰，禁复数\n- 9【强制】不用外键级连\n- 10【强制】单向... 分库分表 单表 500万\n- 11【强制】位存储 Enum 枚举? (亿级以上才用位)\n索引规约...\n- 【推荐】innoDB? Actually: 【推荐】\"存储引擎 InnoDB，字符集 utf8mb4\"? In 阿里手册: 【强制】? I think it's in 索引规约 or 建表: \"【推荐】 库名尽量和应用的名称相对应\" hmm. There's also: \"【强制】表达是与否...\" Let me just recall item: \"【推荐】 ... InnoDB 表\"? Actually I recall: \"【参考】合适的字符存储...\". There's a known one: 【推荐】\"如果有 varchar > ...\"? and \"【推荐】 单实例表数量控制 500\". I believe engine/charset is not explicitly in 阿里 but is in几乎 all company specs derived from it (美团/58). Since the user's spec is unknown, generic best practice review: include engine/charset missing — most reviewers flag it. Also many规范 \"创建表必须显式指定引擎和字符集\" is extremely common as 强制. Include.\n\nvarchar(6): is_xxx must be tinyint unsigned... n/a.\n\nNote also varchar(32) order_no — if orders come from system with fixed-length order numbers, char could be used — undecidable. skip.\n\nAlso missing NOT NULL on remark and text: skip as 建议.\n\nSo DETECTED categories: \n- 表注释缺失\n- 字段注释缺失\n- 缺少必备字段（gmt_create/gmt_modified）\n- 非负字段缺 UNSIGNED\n- 未显式指定存储引擎与字符集\n\nMaybe also \"自增主键未用 unsigned\" folded into unsigned category.\n\nFormat each violation: 字段/表名、违反规则、修改建议. Provide corrected DDL snippet maybe. Output priority: diff or modification summary. I can give a short fixed DDL as \"修改建议\" consolidated.\n\nAlso note: `amount decimal(10,2) DEFAULT '0.00'` — default value for decimal given as string is fine; also `status tinyint DEFAULT '0'` — tinyint without display width deprecated; not a spec issue.\n\nOne more: id bigint AUTO_INCREMENT — Alibaba example: `id bigint unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT` — confirms unsigned rule applies to id. Good.\n\nAlso 表名 t_order_detail: 前缀 t_ — 某些规范要求禁止？No, some require. fine.\n\nAlso: no `NOT NULL` on remark text — text columns... skip.\n\nAlso, charset: since not specified, inherits DB default; spec requires explicit utf8mb4. Include collation utf8mb4_general_ci/0900_ai_ci — keep simple.\n\nNow the DETECTED line: categories in short Chinese phrases, semicolon separated:\nDETECTED: 表注释缺失; 字段注释缺失; 缺少必备审计字段; 非负字段未加UNSIGNED; 存储引擎及字符集未显式指定\n\nKeep each short. Fine.\n\n深度交互 part: brief challenges: (1) 该审查基于通用主流规范（阿里巴巴 Java 开发手册系），未拿到你的具体规范文档；若公司有专有规范（如索引强制、text 禁用），结果会变化——建议贴规范原文对齐。(2) order_no 高概率需要唯一索引（业务键），但静态不可判定，属于业务决策而非规范违规，故未列入。(3) remark text 若走大字段规范建议拆扩展表——列为优化项而非违规。\n\nBut requirement 2 says don't output 泛泛优化建议 — putting them in 深度交互 section as meta-discussion about the review methodology should be acceptable since it's not listing them as violations, and DETECTED doesn't include them. To be safe and strict with the prompt's \"只报告可判定的规范违规\", I'll keep 深度交互 clearly separated and short.\n\nHmm, should 深度交互 come before DETECTED? DETECTED must be the last line (\"最后必须单独输出一行汇总\"). I'll put 深度交互 before it, and make sure DETECTED is standalone final line.\n\nAlso respond in Chinese simplified. Good.\n\nLet me draft the full corrected DDL suggestion:\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE t_order_detail (\n    id bigint unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT COMMENT '主键',\n    order_no varchar(32) NOT NULL COMMENT '业务订单号',\n    remark text COMMENT '备注',\n    amount decimal(10,2) unsigned NOT NULL DEFAULT '0.00' COMMENT '金额',\n    status tinyint unsigned NOT NULL DEFAULT '0' COMMENT '状态:0-...',\n    create_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '创建时间',\n    update_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '更新时间',\n    PRIMARY KEY (id)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COMMENT='订单明细表';\n```\n\nCareful: adding NOT NULL/unsigned are suggestions; core fixes are the flagged ones. I'll present a consolidated fixed version but note the essential changes. Actually to avoid scope creep, the fix suggestion per item suffices; a consolidated snippet is fine as 修改建议.\n\nNote decimal unsigned: MySQL supports decimal unsigned (deprecated warning? In MySQL 8.0.17+, unsigned for decimal deprecated? Actually display width deprecated; unsigned on decimal... In MySQL 8.0.17, UNSIGNED for FLOAT/DOUBLE/DECIMAL is deprecated and generates deprecation warnings! Yes: \"As of MySQL 8.0.17, the UNSIGNED attribute is deprecated for FLOAT, DOUBLE, and DECIMAL\" — it still works but deprecated. Hmm. So flagging amount for unsigned could conflict with MySQL 8.0.17+ deprecation. The spec rule \"非负必须 unsigned\" from 阿里手册 is integer-focused? The rule text: \"任何字段如果为非负数，必须是 unsigned\". Strictly includes decimal. But given MySQL 8 deprecation, many updated specs exclude floating/decimal. To be safe: flag id and status (integers) as the unsigned violations, mention amount as also non-negative (rule literal) — but the deprecation nuance. I'll flag id/status firmly; mention amount under same rule with note (MySQL 8.0.17+ 已弃用 decimal unsigned，可按贵司规范取舍). That's precise and evidence-first.\n\nIn fixed DDL, keep amount decimal(10,2) unsigned? I'd write without unsigned for amount to stay modern-safe, or include with comment. I'll include note and in snippet use unsigned only for id/status. Hmm but then my \"修复示例\" won't fully satisfy the literal rule — acceptable given deprecation note. Keep snippet consistent with flagged items: id/status unsigned; amount keep as-is (mention rule-literal alternative).\n\nNumber the findings 1-5.\n\nAlso one more possible: PRIMARY KEY (id) — naming pk_ rule doesn't apply to PK itself (MySQL always names it PRIMARY). fine.\n\nFinal DETECTED categories (short phrases):\n- 表注释缺失\n- 字段注释缺失\n- 缺少必备字段\n- 非负字段缺unsigned\n- 未指定存储引擎和字符集\n\nI'll use: DETECTED: 表注释缺失; 字段注释缺失; 缺少必备字段(gmt_create/gmt_modified); 非负字段未加UNSIGNED; 存储引擎与字符集未显式指定\n\nMaybe keep them even shorter per example style. OK.\n\nNo tools needed. Write answer.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## 直接执行\n\n静态审查完成。以主流 MySQL 设计规范（阿里 Java 开发手册体系及其派生规范）为基准，可判定违规共 5 类：\n\n**1. 表注释缺失**\n- 位置：表 `t_order_detail`\n- 规则：所有表必须显式写 `COMMENT`\n- 建议：表尾追加 `COMMENT='订单明细表'`\n\n**2. 字段注释缺失**\n- 位置：`id`、`order_no`、`remark`、`amount`、`status` 全部字段\n- 规则：所有字段必须显式写 `COMMENT`（含枚举语义说明）\n- 建议：逐列补充，如 `status ... COMMENT '状态：0-待支付 1-已支付 ...'`\n\n**3. 缺少必备字段 gmt_create / gmt_modified**\n- 位置：表级缺失（仅有 `id`，无创建/更新时间字段）\n- 规则：表必备三字段 `id`、`gmt_create`（create_time）、`gmt_modified`（update_time）\n- 建议：增加\n  ```sql\n  create_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '创建时间',\n  update_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '更新时间'\n  ```\n\n**4. 非负数值字段未加 UNSIGNED**\n- 位置：`id bigint AUTO_INCREMENT`、`status tinyint`\n- 规则：非负语义字段必须 `unsigned`（自增主键示例规范即 `bigint unsigned`）\n- 建议：改为 `id bigint unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT`、`status tinyint unsigned NOT NULL DEFAULT '0'`\n- 注：`amount` 语义上同样非负，字面也在该规则覆盖内，但 MySQL 8.0.17+ 已弃用 DECIMAL 的 unsigned 属性，按贵司规范取舍即可\n\n**5. 存储引擎与字符集未显式指定**\n- 位置：表定义末尾缺 `ENGINE` / `CHARSET`\n- 规则：建表必须显式声明 `ENGINE=InnoDB`、`CHARSET=utf8mb4`\n- 建议：表尾补 `ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4`\n\n修复后示例：\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE t_order_detail (\n    id bigint unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT COMMENT '主键',\n    order_no varchar(32) NOT NULL COMMENT '业务订单号',\n    remark text COMMENT '备注',\n    amount decimal(10,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0.00' COMMENT '金额',\n    status tinyint unsigned NOT NULL DEFAULT '0' COMMENT '状态：0-xx 1-xx',\n    create_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '创建时间',\n    update_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '更新时间',\n    PRIMARY KEY (id)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COMMENT='订单明细表';\n```\n\n## 深度交互\n\n1. **规范基准问题**：你未提供公司具体规范文档，本次按通用主流规范判定。若贵司有专有条款（如强制禁止 `text` 列、强制业务键唯一索引 `uk_order_no`、强制 `t_` 前缀命名），结论会增减——建议贴规范原文做一次对齐，静态审查的「可判定」边界完全取决于规则文本。\n2. **`order_no` 无索引**：业务单号高概率是查询键，按理应有唯一索引；但「是否为业务键」属业务语义，静态不可判定，故未列入违规，仅在此提示为待确认项而非规范违规。\n3. **`remark text`**：大字段拆扩展表属常见建议而非强制违规，按你的输出要求未列入。\n\nDETECTED: 表注释缺失; 字段注释缺失; 缺少必备字段; 非负字段未加UNSIGNED; 存储引擎与字符集未显式指定"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zhipu-coding-plan","model":"glm-5.3","usage":{"input":380,"output":5771,"cacheRead":10816,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16967,"reasoningTokens":4880,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787582930093,"responseId":"20260824224850a8aec685cdb0450d","duration":111296.338708,"ttft":4723.9935829999995},"toolResults":[]}
{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<file name=\"/var/folders/zn/w06grcb53sl3spdn751tgsx80000gn/T/tmph8azvf8c/prompt.md\">\n你是数据库规范审查专家。请审查下面的 MySQL 建表语句（DDL），找出所有违反数据库设计规范的问题。\n用户原话：「帮我审查这个建表语句，看看有没有规范问题。」\n本次为静态审查：你不具备任何工具、不能执行任何脚本，请仅基于你掌握的规范知识逐条判断。\n\n输出要求：\n1. 逐条列出确实违反规范的问题（表名/端点/字段名、违反的规则、修改建议）。\n2. 只报告可判定的规范违规，不要输出泛泛的优化建议。\n3. 最后必须单独输出一行汇总，格式严格为：\nDETECTED: 规则类别1; 规则类别2; ...\n   每个规则类别用简短中文短语（如「禁用类型」「索引命名不规范」「表注释缺失」），用分号分隔；\n   若未发现任何问题，输出 DETECTED: NONE\n\n待审查内容如下：\n----- 文件 example.sql 开始 -----\nCREATE TABLE t_order_detail (\n    id bigint NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n    order_no varchar(32) NOT NULL,\n    remark text,\n    amount decimal(10,2) DEFAULT '0.00',\n    status tinyint DEFAULT '0',\n    PRIMARY KEY (id)\n);\n\n----- 文件 example.sql 结束 -----\n开始审查。\n</file>\n"}],"attribution":"user","timestamp":1787582930024},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze this DDL carefully. The task: static review of MySQL DDL against database design standards. I need to find actual violations, list them with specific details, and output a DETECTED summary line.\n\nThe DDL:\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE t_order_detail (\n    id bigint NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n    order_no varchar(32) NOT NULL,\n    remark text,\n    amount decimal(10,2) DEFAULT '0.00',\n    status tinyint DEFAULT '0',\n    PRIMARY KEY (id)\n);\n```\n\nLet me go through common database design specifications (typical Chinese internet company MySQL specs, e.g., Alibaba Java Development Manual):\n\n1. **Table comment missing** — Table `t_order_detail` has no `COMMENT` on table itself. Common spec: every table and column must have comment. Violation.\n\n2. **Column comments missing** — No column has COMMENT. Violation of column comment rule. Should I merge with table comment? Typically these are separate rules: \"表注释缺失\" and \"字段注释缺失\". Let me count them separately or together. The summary categories should be distinct rule categories. I'll list both.\n\n3. **character set / engine not specified** — Table doesn't specify `ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4`. Many specs require explicitly defining storage engine InnoDB and charset utf8mb4. Violation: \"未显式指定存储引擎/字符集\". Also collation.\n\n4. **amount decimal(10,2) DEFAULT '0.00'** — Hmm. Some specs say amount fields must be decimal, which it is. Some specs require no default for core fields... Actually there's a spec: `decimal` type... Aliyun spec: \"金额字段必须使用 decimal，禁止使用 float/double\" — OK here. Default '0.00' — some specs require default values for fields to avoid NULL; having default is fine.\n\n5. **status tinyint DEFAULT '0'** — tinyint spec: \"任何字段如果是非负数，必须是 unsigned\". status is non-negative semantically, so should be `tinyint unsigned`. This is the famous Alibaba rule: 非负数必须加 unsigned. Violation.\n\n6. **order_no varchar(32)** — index missing? order_no is likely a business key; a spec that requires unique index on business order number... That's more of an inference. But many review tasks would flag \"order_no 未建索引\" — however that's arguably a business decision, not determinable statically. The instruction says \"只报告可判定的规范违规，不要输出泛泛的优化建议\". Missing index on order_no is inference, not decidable. Skip? Hmm. Actually many specs mandate that any field appearing in WHERE queries... not decidable. Skip.\n\n7. **AUTO_INCREMENT + no PK spec**: id bigint AUTO_INCREMENT is fine. PK exists.\n\n8. **DEFAULT '0.00' / DEFAULT '0' quoted strings** — numeric columns with string defaults. MySQL accepts. Some specs disallow quoting numeric defaults? Not a standard rule. Also MySQL 8.0.13+ deprecates... no. Actually `DEFAULT '0.00'` on decimal is fine. Some lint tools flag it, but it's not a common spec rule. Skip.\n\n9. **text type** — remark text: spec \"使用 text 类型需谨慎/尽量少用，text 字段建议拆分到扩展表\"? Alibaba manual doesn't forbid text. Some specs: \"杜绝使用 text/blob 大字段\" or require moving to extension table. Hmm, \"可判定\" — remark text with no NOT NULL... Many specs require text columns be stored in extension table. This is borderline. Some review specs: \"必须把 text 拆分出去,不要与业务表放一起\" (from some company specs). Not universal. I could mention but risk being \"泛泛\". Let me think about what's most standard.\n\nCommon rules from 阿里巴巴Java开发手册 (MySQL database section):\n1. 强制：表达是与否概念的字段，必须使用 is_xxx，tinyint unsigned (1 是 0 否) — status is 概念字段? status is not boolean; is_xxx rule applies to boolean-like fields. status tinyint for enum is common. Not violation of that rule.\n2. 强制：任何字段如果为非负数，必须是 unsigned。→ status, id (id auto positive). Actually id is auto-increment, also non-negative → should be bigint unsigned. Many review reports flag both id and status. But primary key auto increment unsigned... The rule literally applies. Flagging id bigint AUTO_INCREMENT missing unsigned: many specs say PK should be bigint unsigned. I'll flag both id and status under 「非负字段缺 unsigned」.\n3. 强制：小数类型为 decimal，禁止 float/double。OK compliant.\n4. 强制：如果存储的字符串长度几乎相等，使用 char。varchar(32) order_no fixed-ish? order_no variable. Skip.\n5. 强制：varchar 是可变长字符串，不预先分配存储空间，长度不要超过 5000 — OK.\n6. 强制：表必备三字段：id, gmt_create (create_time), gmt_modified (update_time)。→ t_order_detail lacks create_time/update_time. Violation: 「缺少必备字段」. Very standard rule (阿里: id, gmt_create, gmt_modified)。Flag.\n7. 强制：库名、表名、字段名必须小写，禁止驼峰。— all lowercase here. OK. t_order_detail follows \"增加前缀 t_?\" Actually Alibaba says 禁用保留字，库名与应用名称一致... 表名不使用复数。order_detail singular, OK. Some companies require \"表名使用业务前缀\"... t_ prefix present. OK.\n8. 强制：禁用保留字：desc, range, match, delayed... — no reserved words here. status? Not reserved in MySQL (STATUS not reserved). OK.\n9. 强制：主键索引名 pk_xxx；唯一索引 uk_xxx；普通索引 idx_xxx — here PRIMARY KEY (id) — the PK name convention is `PRIMARY` in MySQL, can't rename; typically rule applies to explicit indexes. No named indexes here, so nothing to flag for naming? PRIMARY KEY (id) doesn't need pk_ name. OK skip index naming.\n10. 强制：不得使用外键与级联，一切外键概念必须在应用层解决 — no FKs. OK.\n11. 强制：禁止使用存储过程。OK.\n12. 推荐：innoDB，utf8mb4。表必须显式指定 ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4。缺省时 MySQL 默认 InnoDB（5.7+）和 charset 由库决定；规范要求显式声明。Violation: 「未显式指定存储引擎/字符集」.\n13. 强制：所有表/字段必须有注释 (B. 建议? Actually it's 强制: \"字段允许适当冗余...\"; comment rule: 【强制】\"表和字段必须有注释\"? In 阿里手册: 【强制】\"任何字段...注释\"... hmm. Actually it's: 【推荐】表和字段... no wait. Let me recall: 阿里手册 MySQL 建表规约: 【强制】\"...\" I recall item: 【推荐】\"如果有...\"; There's a rule: 【强制】\"单表行数超过 500 万行...分库分表\". And comments: \"所有的表和字段都要有注释\" — I believe it's 【推荐】in older versions but widely treated as mandatory in company specs. In any case, common review flags missing COMMENT. I'll flag.\n14. 单表行数/字段数: 字段数不超过 X? Not relevant.\n15. is_xxx: not present.\n16. DEFAULT: 阿里手册: 【强制】\"修改数据...\"; there's \"如果字段有默认值，...\" Hmm. Also \"禁止使用 DEFAULT 'CURRENT_TIMESTAMP' 之外的...\" no.\n\nAlso: text column remark nullable with no default — spec \"字段建议 NOT NULL / 定义默认值，避免 NULL\" (many specs: 尽量所有列 NOT NULL). That's 推荐/优化, borderline. Could flag as 「允许 NULL 字段」— remark text NULL-able. Many company specs mandate NOT NULL where possible. But decidable? It's decidable that remark allows NULL. Whether that violates spec depends. I'd rather include as a rule category \"字段允许 NULL\" — hmm, risk of being \"泛泛建议\". The instruction: only report decidable violations. Missing comment, missing create/update time, unsigned, engine/charset are the classic four. Also \"索引命名\" not applicable.\n\nAlso AUTO_INCREMENT: spec \"禁止使用 AUTO_INCREMENT\"? No, that's for分库分表场景. Skip.\n\nAlso decimal(10,2) for amount — spec says decimal OK; some say money needs decimal(10,2)? fine. DEFAULT '0.00' — note: MySQL: decimal default as string ok. Some specs require numeric defaults unquoted — not standard. Skip.\n\nAlso missing unique key on order_no? Business inference. Skip per \"只报告可判定\".\n\nAlso table name \"t_order_detail\" — some specs: 表名不超过 30 字符? fine. 有 t_ 前缀? Some companies require it; present.\n\nNow, no tool use needed — the prompt explicitly says static review, no tools. 