(美团/58). Since the user's spec is unknown, generic best practice review: include engine/charset missing — most reviewers flag it. Also many规范 \"创建表必须显式指定引擎和字符集\" is extremely common as 强制. Include.\n\nvarchar(6): is_xxx must be tinyint unsigned... n/a.\n\nNote also varchar(32) order_no — if orders come from system with fixed-length order numbers, char could be used — undecidable. skip.\n\nAlso missing NOT NULL on remark and text: skip as 建议.\n\nSo DETECTED categories: \n- 表注释缺失\n- 字段注释缺失\n- 缺少必备字段（gmt_create/gmt_modified）\n- 非负字段缺 UNSIGNED\n- 未显式指定存储引擎与字符集\n\nMaybe also \"自增主键未用 unsigned\" folded into unsigned category.\n\nFormat each violation: 字段/表名、违反规则、修改建议. Provide corrected DDL snippet maybe. Output priority: diff or modification summary. I can give a short fixed DDL as \"修改建议\" consolidated.\n\nAlso note: `amount decimal(10,2) DEFAULT '0.00'` — default value for decimal given as string is fine; also `status tinyint DEFAULT '0'` — tinyint without display width deprecated; not a spec issue.\n\nOne more: id bigint AUTO_INCREMENT — Alibaba example: `id bigint unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT` — confirms unsigned rule applies to id. Good.\n\nAlso 表名 t_order_detail: 前缀 t_ — 某些规范要求禁止？No, some require. fine.\n\nAlso: no `NOT NULL` on remark text — text columns... skip.\n\nAlso, charset: since not specified, inherits DB default; spec requires explicit utf8mb4. Include collation utf8mb4_general_ci/0900_ai_ci — keep simple.\n\nNow the DETECTED line: categories in short Chinese phrases, semicolon separated:\nDETECTED: 表注释缺失; 字段注释缺失; 缺少必备审计字段; 非负字段未加UNSIGNED; 存储引擎及字符集未显式指定\n\nKeep each short. Fine.\n\n深度交互 part: brief challenges: (1) 该审查基于通用主流规范（阿里巴巴 Java 开发手册系），未拿到你的具体规范文档；若公司有专有规范（如索引强制、text 禁用），结果会变化——建议贴规范原文对齐。(2) order_no 高概率需要唯一索引（业务键），但静态不可判定，属于业务决策而非规范违规，故未列入。(3) remark text 若走大字段规范建议拆扩展表——列为优化项而非违规。\n\nBut requirement 2 says don't output 泛泛优化建议 — putting them in 深度交互 section as meta-discussion about the review methodology should be acceptable since it's not listing them as violations, and DETECTED doesn't include them. To be safe and strict with the prompt's \"只报告可判定的规范违规\", I'll keep 深度交互 clearly separated and short.\n\nHmm, should 深度交互 come before DETECTED? DETECTED must be the last line (\"最后必须单独输出一行汇总\"). I'll put 深度交互 before it, and make sure DETECTED is standalone final line.\n\nAlso respond in Chinese simplified. Good.\n\nLet me draft the full corrected DDL suggestion:\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE t_order_detail (\n    id bigint unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT COMMENT '主键',\n    order_no varchar(32) NOT NULL COMMENT '业务订单号',\n    remark text COMMENT '备注',\n    amount decimal(10,2) unsigned NOT NULL DEFAULT '0.00' COMMENT '金额',\n    status tinyint unsigned NOT NULL DEFAULT '0' COMMENT '状态:0-...',\n    create_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '创建时间',\n    update_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '更新时间',\n    PRIMARY KEY (id)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COMMENT='订单明细表';\n```\n\nCareful: adding NOT NULL/unsigned are suggestions; core fixes are the flagged ones. I'll present a consolidated fixed version but note the essential changes. Actually to avoid scope creep, the fix suggestion per item suffices; a consolidated snippet is fine as 修改建议.\n\nNote decimal unsigned: MySQL supports decimal unsigned (deprecated warning? In MySQL 8.0.17+, unsigned for decimal deprecated? Actually display width deprecated; unsigned on decimal... In MySQL 8.0.17, UNSIGNED for FLOAT/DOUBLE/DECIMAL is deprecated and generates deprecation warnings! Yes: \"As of MySQL 8.0.17, the UNSIGNED attribute is deprecated for FLOAT, DOUBLE, and DECIMAL\" — it still works but deprecated. Hmm. So flagging amount for unsigned could conflict with MySQL 8.0.17+ deprecation. The spec rule \"非负必须 unsigned\" from 阿里手册 is integer-focused? The rule text: \"任何字段如果为非负数，必须是 unsigned\". Strictly includes decimal. But given MySQL 8 deprecation, many updated specs exclude floating/decimal. To be safe: flag id and status (integers) as the unsigned violations, mention amount as also non-negative (rule literal) — but the deprecation nuance. I'll flag id/status firmly; mention amount under same rule with note (MySQL 8.0.17+ 已弃用 decimal unsigned，可按贵司规范取舍). That's precise and evidence-first.\n\nIn fixed DDL, keep amount decimal(10,2) unsigned? I'd write without unsigned for amount to stay modern-safe, or include with comment. I'll include note and in snippet use unsigned only for id/status. Hmm but then my \"修复示例\" won't fully satisfy the literal rule — acceptable given deprecation note. Keep snippet consistent with flagged items: id/status unsigned; amount keep as-is (mention rule-literal alternative).\n\nNumber the findings 1-5.\n\nAlso one more possible: PRIMARY KEY (id) — naming pk_ rule doesn't apply to PK itself (MySQL always names it PRIMARY). fine.\n\nFinal DETECTED categories (short phrases):\n- 表注释缺失\n- 字段注释缺失\n- 缺少必备字段\n- 非负字段缺unsigned\n- 未指定存储引擎和字符集\n\nI'll use: DETECTED: 表注释缺失; 字段注释缺失; 缺少必备字段(gmt_create/gmt_modified); 非负字段未加UNSIGNED; 存储引擎与字符集未显式指定\n\nMaybe keep them even shorter per example style. OK.\n\nNo tools needed. Write answer.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## 直接执行\n\n静态审查完成。以主流 MySQL 设计规范（阿里 Java 开发手册体系及其派生规范）为基准，可判定违规共 5 类：\n\n**1. 表注释缺失**\n- 位置：表 `t_order_detail`\n- 规则：所有表必须显式写 `COMMENT`\n- 建议：表尾追加 `COMMENT='订单明细表'`\n\n**2. 字段注释缺失**\n- 位置：`id`、`order_no`、`remark`、`amount`、`status` 全部字段\n- 规则：所有字段必须显式写 `COMMENT`（含枚举语义说明）\n- 建议：逐列补充，如 `status ... COMMENT '状态：0-待支付 1-已支付 ...'`\n\n**3. 缺少必备字段 gmt_create / gmt_modified**\n- 位置：表级缺失（仅有 `id`，无创建/更新时间字段）\n- 规则：表必备三字段 `id`、`gmt_create`（create_time）、`gmt_modified`（update_time）\n- 建议：增加\n  ```sql\n  create_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '创建时间',\n  update_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '更新时间'\n  ```\n\n**4. 非负数值字段未加 UNSIGNED**\n- 位置：`id bigint AUTO_INCREMENT`、`status tinyint`\n- 规则：非负语义字段必须 `unsigned`（自增主键示例规范即 `bigint unsigned`）\n- 建议：改为 `id bigint unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT`、`status tinyint unsigned NOT NULL DEFAULT '0'`\n- 注：`amount` 语义上同样非负，字面也在该规则覆盖内，但 MySQL 8.0.17+ 已弃用 DECIMAL 的 unsigned 属性，按贵司规范取舍即可\n\n**5. 存储引擎与字符集未显式指定**\n- 位置：表定义末尾缺 `ENGINE` / `CHARSET`\n- 规则：建表必须显式声明 `ENGINE=InnoDB`、`CHARSET=utf8mb4`\n- 建议：表尾补 `ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4`\n\n修复后示例：\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE t_order_detail (\n    id bigint unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT COMMENT '主键',\n    order_no varchar(32) NOT NULL COMMENT '业务订单号',\n    remark text COMMENT '备注',\n    amount decimal(10,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0.00' COMMENT '金额',\n    status tinyint unsigned NOT NULL DEFAULT '0' COMMENT '状态：0-xx 1-xx',\n    create_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '创建时间',\n    update_time datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '更新时间',\n    PRIMARY KEY (id)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COMMENT='订单明细表';\n```\n\n## 深度交互\n\n1. **规范基准问题**：你未提供公司具体规范文档，本次按通用主流规范判定。若贵司有专有条款（如强制禁止 `text` 列、强制业务键唯一索引 `uk_order_no`、强制 `t_` 前缀命名），结论会增减——建议贴规范原文做一次对齐，静态审查的「可判定」边界完全取决于规则文本。\n2. **`order_no` 无索引**：业务单号高概率是查询键，按理应有唯一索引；但「是否为业务键」属业务语义，静态不可判定，故未列入违规，仅在此提示为待确认项而非规范违规。\n3. **`remark text`**：大字段拆扩展表属常见建议而非强制违规，按你的输出要求未列入。\n\nDETECTED: 表注释缺失; 字段注释缺失; 缺少必备字段; 非负字段未加UNSIGNED; 存储引擎与字符集未显式指定"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zhipu-coding-plan","model":"glm-5.3","usage":{"input":380,"output":5771,"cacheRead":10816,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16967,"reasoningTokens":4880,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787582930093,"responseId":"20260824224850a8aec685cdb0450d","duration":111296.338708,"ttft":4723.9935829999995}],"isTerminal":true}

